          "comment": "# Comfy Depth Estimation- Marigold V2\n\nEstimate scene depth from an input image using Marigold V2, generating a depth map with brighter areas representing closer objects and darker areas representing farther objects. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/image_marigold_v2_depth_estimation.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
